    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight up 1 kg since treatment began; no fever or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No blurred vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry mouth on amitriptyline; cold resolved</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or fainting; palpitations only in past prodromes</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild constipation on amitriptyline; wind between episodes less troublesome; no vomiting since the three-month review</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hesitancy or urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No rash or changing moles</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headaches or dizziness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 score 0; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No heat or cold intolerance</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

