    <td>R11.15</td><td>S — Synthetic provisional diagnosis at the gastroenterology consultation, anchored to his documented episodic vomiting. It is clinical, with no confirmatory test, and does not confirm any historical theory.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-2">
