    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Advance care planning was introduced as part of routine preventive care. He has no advance directive. He would like the person he lives with to speak for him if he could not, and took home the health care agent form; the agent is not named in this record. He said that what matters most is being able to keep working and to be told plainly what is known and what is not. No treatment decisions were made. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
